  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">219594_FY22_WFP_Ethiopia_NW and SW Tigray Food Assistance_CLOSED</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WVUK has a share of 840,028 beneficiaries - 2.704% share = 22714 individuals
 
 .
 
  
 
 Output 1.1: World Vision Ethiopia will distribute 113,907.80 MT of food baskets (consisting of cereals, pulses and oil) to 840,028 conflict-affect vulnerable people across all twelve target areas.
 
  
 
 Output 1.2: World Vision Ethiopia will conduct awareness-raising activities on IYCF practices, hygiene, nutrition, primary health care and protection for all beneficiaries collecting food baskets across all twelve target areas.[1]
 
  
 
 Output 1.3: well-coordinated assistance distribution for targeted conflict-affected people in the Southern and Northwest zones, Tigray.</narrative>
  </description>
